<ptxt>Mismatch between the direct line and the multiplex communication signal between the instrument panel J/B assembly (main body ECU) and engine control computer (engine ECU)</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry colname="C03" valign="middle" align="left">
<list1 type="unordered">
