<testgrp id="X39400000IG00RC_13_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___00004AH00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness (Instrument Panel J/B Assembly (Main Body ECU) - Engine Control Computer (Engine ECU))</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Resistance Inspection</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A161588J03" width="7.106578999in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<test2>
<ptxt>Disconnect instrument panel J/B assembly (main body ECU) connector T and engine control computer (engine ECU) connector B.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), inspect the resistance between the terminals of the vehicle side wire harness connector.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.63in"/>
<colspec colname="COLSPEC0" colwidth="0.70in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.80in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
<ptxt>(Main Body ECU - Engine ECU)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>T2(TACH) - B15(TACH)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), inspect the resistance between each terminal of the vehicle side wire harness connector and body ground.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.63in"/>
<colspec colname="COLSPEC1" colwidth="0.69in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.81in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
<ptxt>(Main Body ECU or Engine ECU - Body Ground)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>T2 (TACH) or B15 (TACH) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>10k Ω or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400000IG00RC_13_0003" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="X39400000IG00RC_13_0006" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000IG00RC_13_0003" proc-id="RM0550J___00004AI00000">
<testtitle>Replace with Known Good Instrument Panel J/B Assembly (Main Body ECU)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Replace the instrument panel J/B assembly (main body ECU) with a new or known good one and perform the inspection in step 1 again.</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400000IG00RC_13_0005" fin="true">OK</down>
<right ref="X39400000IG00RC_13_0007" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000IG00RC_13_0007">
<testtitle>Replace Engine Control Computer<xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000020V0005X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000IG00RC_13_0006">
<testtitle>Repair or Replace Wire Harness or Connector</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000IG00RC_13_0005">
<testtitle>OK (instrument panel J/B assembly malfunction)</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
